msgid "Modernizing a 50-Year Legacy Under Mr. Mohammed Al Nuaimi"
msgstr "تحديث إرث يمتد لـ 50 عاماً بقيادة السيد محمد النعيمي"

msgid "Led by CEO Mr. Mohammed Yousef Nasser Al Nuaimi, Yousuf Bin Nasser & Sons Real Estate strategically transformed into Edrak Properties. The rebrand united 50+ years of family pedigree with modern institutional governance, digital contract workflows, and data-backed yield advisory."
