msgid "Our family has entrusted our Ajman residential buildings to Yousuf Bin Nasser & Sons—and now Edrak Properties—for over two decades. Under Mr. Mohammed Al Nuaimi's leadership, our occupancy has remained near 100% and our maintenance costs are the most transparent in the Emirates."
